From: fleet health agent <agent@choatelabs.local>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: ci(release): gate installer builds on the production-bundle smoke test

Apply from the repo root with:  git apply docs/health/2026-07-28-release-smoke-gate.patch
(Stack on PR #7 / branch agent/health-2026-07-27 so the gate uses the
hardened prod-smoke.mjs; merge that PR first.)
---
 .github/workflows/release.yml | 14 ++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/release.yml b/.github/workflows/release.yml
index bd61fd8..0000000 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/release.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/release.yml
@@ -52,6 +52,20 @@ jobs:
       - name: Install frontend dependencies
         run: npm ci
 
+      # Gate the release on the production-bundle smoke test (the v1.2.1
+      # white-screen crash class — a broken chunk graph must never ship in
+      # signed installers again). `npm run smoke` runs `vite build` and then
+      # scripts/prod-smoke.mjs against the built bundle on every matrix leg,
+      # failing the job before the expensive Rust compile. Chromium installs
+      # without --with-deps: macOS/Windows runners already carry the browser
+      # system libraries.
+      - name: Install Chromium for smoke test
+        run: npx playwright install chromium
+
+      - name: Production bundle smoke test
+        run: npm run smoke
+
       # NOTARIZATION TEMPORARILY DISABLED (2026-06-06): the APPLE_ID /
       # APPLE_PASSWORD secrets fail Apple auth with HTTP 401 (APPLE_PASSWORD is
       # 20 chars; an app-specific password is exactly 19: xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx).
